---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Trust Guides — Learn About Trusts | FreeTrustDocs';
const description = 'Free educational guides about trusts: what is a Certificate of Trust, land trust vs LLC, how to choose a trustee, revocable vs irrevocable, and more.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span>›</span> Guides
      </div>
      <h1>Trust Guides</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Learn about trust documents, structures, and administration. Each guide is written to be genuinely
        educational — not keyword-stuffed legal jargon. Free, no signup required.
      </p>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem;">

        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d4cfc4); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/guide/what-is-a-certificate-of-trust/">What is a Certificate of Trust?</a></h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            What a Certificate of Trust is, when you need one, and what it must contain.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d4cfc4); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/guide/what-is-a-declaration-of-trust/">What is a Declaration of Trust?</a></h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            How a Declaration of Trust creates a trust, and the roles of settlor, trustee, and beneficiary.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d4cfc4); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/guide/what-is-a-land-trust/">What is a Land Trust?</a></h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            How land trusts provide real estate privacy and probate avoidance, and which states recognize them.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d4cfc4); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/guide/land-trust-vs-llc/">Land Trust vs LLC</a></h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            Side-by-side comparison: privacy, asset protection, cost, and when to use each structure.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d4cfc4); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/guide/how-to-choose-a-trustee/">How to Choose a Trustee</a></h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            Key factors in selecting a trustee, professional vs family, and co-trustee arrangements.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d4cfc4); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/guide/revocable-vs-irrevocable-trust/">Revocable vs Irrevocable Trust</a></h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            The fundamental distinction in trust law — flexibility vs protection, and when each makes sense.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d4cfc4); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/guide/trust-funding-checklist/">Trust Funding Checklist</a></h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            What assets to transfer into your trust, how to transfer them, and why an unfunded trust is useless.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d4cfc4); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/guide/certificate-of-trust-vs-declaration/">Certificate vs Declaration of Trust</a></h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            One creates the trust, the other proves it exists. You need both — here's the difference.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d4cfc4); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/guide/business-trust-explained/">Business Trust Explained</a></h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            Massachusetts Trusts, their history, structure, modern uses, and how they compare to LLCs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d4cfc4); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/guide/trust-trustee-duties/">Trustee Duties and Responsibilities</a></h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            Fiduciary duties: loyalty, prudence, impartiality, accounting — and what happens when they're breached.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d4cfc4); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/guide/how-to-revoke-a-trust/">How to Revoke a Trust</a></h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            Revocation clauses, required steps, asset retitling, and state-specific requirements.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #d4cfc4); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/guide/trust-protector-explained/">What is a Trust Protector?</a></h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
            The role of a trust protector, their powers, and when to appoint one for long-term trusts.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
        <h2>Ready to Create Your Trust Document?</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">
          Our free generators walk you through the process step by step. No signup. Nothing leaves your browser.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
          <a href="/create/certificate-of-trust/" class="btn btn-primary">Certificate of Trust →</a>
          <a href="/create/declaration-of-trust/" class="btn btn-outline">Declaration of Trust →</a>
          <a href="/create/land-trust/" class="btn btn-outline">Land Trust →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="upl-notice" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <strong>Not a law firm.</strong> FreeTrustDocs.com is not a law firm and does not provide legal advice.
        These guides are for educational purposes only. Consult a licensed attorney in your jurisdiction before
        making legal decisions.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>